 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-7§1 Shared conventions: signal query (1): hasNeighborSignal returns at the first hit of down, up, north, south, west, east (result, index)" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "0 0 0 0 0 0" TO WS-IN
