     CALL "RS1-HAS-NEIGHBOR" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-R1 WS-R2
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 0 0 0 7 0" TO WS-IN
