     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-7§1 Shared conventions: flags used (1): hand toggles of doors and gates 10, redstone writes of doors, trapdoors, gates and the lamp 2, the trapdoor hand toggle 2, bulb writes" TO TL-CASE
